sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor B as 👩‍🎨 Browser
    participant DNS as 🌐 DNS
    participant CF as ⚡ CloudFront edge
    participant APP as 🖥️ EC2 · app container
    participant DB as 🗄️ RDS MySQL
    participant S3 as 🪣 S3 bucket

    B->>DNS: where is www.artistikcity.com?
    DNS-->>B: CNAME → dxxxx.cloudfront.net → nearest edge IP
    rect rgb(237, 228, 255)
        Note over B,CF: HTTPS handshake with the ACM certificate
        B->>CF: GET /courses (cookies included)
        CF->>APP: GET /courses + X-Origin-Verify + CloudFront-Viewer-Address (plain HTTP inside AWS, port 80)
        APP->>APP: CloudFrontFilter checks the secret, takes visitor IP + https
        APP->>DB: SELECT courses … (TLS)
        DB-->>APP: rows
        APP-->>CF: HTML page (gzip) · never cached
        CF-->>B: page
    end
    rect rgb(232, 245, 214)
        Note over B,S3: The page's images and videos
        B->>CF: GET /storage/uploads/courses/110/cover.jpg
        alt already in this edge's cache
            CF-->>B: image (cache hit, ~10 ms)
        else first request at this edge
            CF->>S3: GetObject storage/uploads/… (signed by Origin Access Control)
            S3-->>CF: image + Cache-Control: max-age=86400
            CF-->>B: image (kept at the edge for a day)
        end
        B->>CF: GET /js/app.js?v=3f2a… · /css/ac-theme.css?v=…
        CF-->>B: from edge cache (fetched from the app once per version)
    end
